            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say the colours and their stories: लाल, a red gem's name; नीला, indigo's dark blue; सफ़ेद, a Persian loan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: साड़ी",
          "segments": [
